@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 쿠키 로그인(Origin 있음): 200 + Set-Cookie: ...; SameSite=Lax
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/token-cookie
Origin: http://localhost:8080
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"kdt01","password":"kdt1234"}

> {% client.global.set("access", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 2. 쿠키로 재발급(허용 Origin): 200
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/token/refresh-cookie
Origin: http://localhost:8080

### 3. Origin 없이 재발급: 403 origin not allowed (CookieOriginConfig)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/token/refresh-cookie

### 4. 외부 Origin으로 재발급: 403 (CORS에서 먼저 거절, 컨트롤러 도달 안 함)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/token/refresh-cookie
Origin: https://evil.example

### 5. 프론트(127.0.0.1:8000) preflight: 200 + Access-Control-Allow-Origin
OPTIONS {{base}}/api/v1/posts
Origin: http://127.0.0.1:8000
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST

### 6. Bearer API는 그대로: 201 (헤더 인증이라 CSRF 대상 아님)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"최종 구조","body":"access는 헤더, refresh는 쿠키"}

### 7. 로그아웃(허용 Origin): 204
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout-cookie
Origin: http://localhost:8080
